        {
          "id": "ml-cross-validation-tuning-block-3",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n    data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n    data-cell-id=\"dGch\"\n    data-reactive=\"true\"\n>\n    <marimo-cell-output>\n    <span></span>\n    </marimo-cell-output>\n    <marimo-cell-code hidden>ml_exercise_06_description%20%3D%20mo.md(%22%22%22%0A%23%23%23%20Exercise%0A%0ADefine%20%60cv_summary(scores)%60%20returning%20%60(mean%2C%20population_standard_deviation)%60%0Awithout%20external%20libraries.%0A%22%22%22)%0Aml_exercise_06_starter%20%3D%20mo.ui.code_editor(%0A%20%20%20%20value%3D'def%20cv_summary(scores)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20mean%20%3D%20sum(scores)%20%2F%20len(scores)%5Cn%20%20%20%20variance%20%3D%20sum((score%20-%20mean)%20**%202%20for%20score%20in%20scores)%20%2F%20len(scores)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20mean%2C%20variance%20**%200.5'%2C%0A%20%20%20%20language%3D%22python%22%2C%20label%3D%22Your%20Python%20answer%22%2C%20min_height%3D170%2C%0A)%0Aml_exercise_06_submit%20%3D%20mo.ui.run_button(label%3D%22Submit%20answer%22)</marimo-cell-code>\n</marimo-island>",
          "visible": false
        },
        {
          "id": "ml-cross-validation-tuning-block-4",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n            data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n            data-cell-id=\"DpZg\"\n            data-reactive=\"true\"\n        >\n            <marimo-cell-output><marimo-ui-element data-mlphd-island-source-guard hidden object-id='39357c03-0ef7-969e-b5f3-1a9371a4ae8d' random-id='39357c03-0ef7-969e-b5f3-1a9371a4ae8d'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;@assertion(lambda _ns: None)&#92;ndef _submission(source):&#92;n    _ns = execute_submission(source)&#92;n    _mean, _std = _ns[&#92;&quot;cv_summary&#92;&quot;]([0.7, 0.8, 0.9])&#92;n    assert abs(_mean - 0.8) &#92;u003c 1e-12, &#92;&quot;mean is incorrect&#92;&quot;&#92;n    assert abs(_std - (0.02 / 3) ** 0.5) &#92;u003c 1e-12, &#92;&quot;population standard deviation is incorrect&#92;&quot;&#92;n    return _ns&#92;n&#92;nproblem(mo, ml_exercise_06_description, ml_exercise_06_starter, _submission, ml_exercise_06_submit)&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n            <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"exercise\">Exercise</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Define <code>cv_summary(scores)</code> returning <code>(mean, population_standard_deviation)</code>\nwithout external libraries.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='dGch-0' random-id='84633a51-f2cf-540e-3342-686d80b80369'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def cv_summary(scores):&#92;n    mean = sum(scores) / len(scores)&#92;n    variance = sum((score - mean) ** 2 for score in scores) / len(scores)&#92;n    return mean, variance ** 0.5&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eYour Python answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='170' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='dGch-1' random-id='b2118ca3-513f-e8bc-dd1b-ed0cc85eb3a0'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSubmit answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eEdit the answer, then click Submit answer.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>\n            </marimo-cell-output>\n            <marimo-cell-code hidden>%40assertion(lambda%20_ns%3A%20None)%0Adef%20_submission(source)%3A%0A%20%20%20%20_ns%20%3D%20execute_submission(source)%0A%20%20%20%20_mean%2C%20_std%20%3D%20_ns%5B%22cv_summary%22%5D(%5B0.7%2C%200.8%2C%200.9%5D)%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20abs(_mean%20-%200.8)%20%3C%201e-12%2C%20%22mean%20is%20incorrect%22%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20abs(_std%20-%20(0.02%20%2F%203)%20**%200.5)%20%3C%201e-12%2C%20%22population%20standard%20deviation%20is%20incorrect%22%0A%20%20%20%20return%20_ns%0A%0Aproblem(mo%2C%20ml_exercise_06_description%2C%20ml_exercise_06_starter%2C%20_submission%2C%20ml_exercise_06_submit)</marimo-cell-code>\n        </marimo-island>",
